ost\",\"overview\":\"The Sparticles find a third person with 'powers' like Reese, and the mission to rid the world of Queen Kylie moves up a step with the discovery of a curious map.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6A8oiazk749fXZMDftw9x6zzWzn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-19\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Comet\",\"overview\":\"Reese uses her 'powers' and the help of Holodora to work out the secret to ridding the world of Queen Kylie and the Teen Parents.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gJ9HVczLrGTd8Qi6cjs02zNA2P0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-26\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Teen Father\",\"overview\":\"Ernesto stages a rebel rescue mission to spring Orion from Kylie's citadel, and learns how he was nearly named something very less revolutionary at birth.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hiIm3sqmOLV9KQPpWztQ1bVRKeG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-02\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Wild Things\",\"overview\":\"Frankie's hunt for her lost rabbit discovers the spooky forest-dwellers, a new Sensitive and a case of identity theft by a 'friend' of Queen Kylie.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/664udZ5rO0idyr03IongRfppNOS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-09\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Zone\",\"overview\":\"Reese and Aris have a close encounter with the missing adults and Holly's mystery illness is diagnosed by a new sensitive with healing powers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n0OtAbdtAfDHcAb96VLGDp2GV5M.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-16\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Fisher Girls\",\"overview\":\"Queen Boudicca's daughter wants to help the Sparticles fight against Queen Kylie but she urgently needs to return to her own dimension to fight the Romans.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u